ions for now.":"আপনি আপাতত AI পরামর্শের সীমায় পৌঁছেছেন।","See original ({{language}})":"মূল দেখুন ({{language}})","See translation ({{language}})":"অনুবাদ দেখুন ({{language}})"},ca:{reviews:"resenyes","Based on":"Basat en","All Reviews":"Totes les ressenyes","Load More":"Carrega'n més","Owner Reply":"Resposta del propietari","Read more":"Llegir més","View on":"Veure a","Overall Rating":"Valoració general",on:"activat","{{number}} reviews":"{{number}} ressenyes","out of 5":"de 5",Hide:"Amaga","Verified by {{supplierName}}":"Verificat per {{supplierName}}","Top Rated on {{supplierName}}":"Millor valorat a {{supplierName}}","Review us on {{supplierName}}":"Valora'ns a {{supplierName}}","AI-Generated Summary":"Resum generat per IA","Very Good":"Molt bo",Good:"Bé","Posted on":"Publicat el","Top Rated on {{firstSourceTitle}} and {{secondSourceTitle}}":"Millor valorat a {{firstSourceTitle}} i {{secondSourceTitle}}","Verified Customer":"Client verificat","Top Rated on {{firstSourceTitle}}, {{secondSourceTitle}} & More":"Millor valorat a {{firstSourceTitle}}, {{secondSourceTitle}} i més",Excellent:"Excel·lent","Amazon’s Choice":"Elecció d'Amazon","Best Seller on Amazon":"Més venut a Amazon","There are no comments available for this review.":"No hi ha comentaris disponibles per a aquesta ressenya.","Guest Favorite on Airbnb":"Favorit dels hostes a Airbnb","Top Rated App":"Aplicació millor valorada","Best Value on Capterra":"Millor valor a Capterra","Leader on G2":"Líder a G2","Left a 1-star rating. Needs improvement.":"Ha deixat una valoració d'1 estrella. Cal millorar.","Star Seller on Etsy":"Venedor estrella a Etsy","Top Performer on Capterra":"Millor valorat a Capterra","Top Rated Seller on AliExpress":"Venedor millor valorat a AliExpress","Left a 4-star rating. Very good!":"Ha deixat una valoració de 4 estrelles. Molt bé!","Top Rated on Facebook":"Millor valorat a Facebook","Left a 3-star rating. It was okay!":"Ha deixat una valoració de 3 estrelles. Estava bé!","Top Rat