ly helps us.":"คุณช่วยคัดลอกรีวิวของคุณและแชร์บนแพลตฟอร์มอื่น ๆ ได้ไหม? ใช้เวลาเพียงครู่เดียวและช่วยเราได้มากจริง ๆ",Posting:"กำลังโพสต์","Write Again":"เขียนอีกครั้ง","Write with AI":"เขียนด้วย AI","Hang on, your review is being written…":"กรุณารอสักครู่ กำลังเขียนรีวิวของคุณ…","Share key points to generate a review":"แบ่งปันประเด็นสำคัญเพื่อสร้างรีวิว","You've reached the limit of AI suggestions for now.":"คุณถึงขีดจำกัดของคำแนะนำ AI ในขณะนี้แล้ว","See original ({{language}})":"ดูเวอร์ชันต้นฉบับ ({{language}})","See translation ({{language}})":"ดูการแปล ({{language}})"},tr:{reviews:"yorumlar","Based on":"Dayalı olarak","All Reviews":"Tüm Yorumlar","Load More":"Daha fazla yükle","Owner Reply":"Sahibinin Yanıtı","Read more":"Daha fazla oku","View on":"Şurada görüntüle","Overall Rating":"Genel Puan",on:"açık","{{number}} reviews":"{{number}} inceleme","out of 5":"5 üzerinden",Hide:"Gizle","Verified by {{supplierName}}":"{{supplierName}} tarafından doğrulandı","Top Rated on {{supplierName}}":"{{supplierName}}'de En Yüksek Puanlı","Review us on {{supplierName}}":"Bizi {{supplierName}} üzerinde değerlendirin","AI-Generated Summary":"Yapay Zeka Tarafından Oluşturulan Özet","Very Good":"Çok iyi",Good:"İyi","Posted on":"Yayınlanma tarihi","Top Rated on {{firstSourceTitle}} and {{secondSourceTitle}}":"{{firstSourceTitle}} ve {{secondSourceTitle}}'de en yüksek puan alan","Verified Customer":"Doğrulanmış Müşteri","Top Rated on {{firstSourceTitle}}, {{secondSourceTitle}} & More":"{{firstSourceTitle}}, {{secondSourceTitle}} ve daha fazlasında en yüksek puanlı",Excellent:"Mükemmel","Amazon’s Choice":"Amazon'un Seçimi","Best Seller on Amazon":"Amazon'da En Çok Satan","There are no comments available for this review.":"Bu inceleme için yorum bulunmamaktadır.","Guest Favorite on Airbnb":"Airbnb'de Misafirlerin Favorisi","Top Rated App":"En yüksek puanlı uygulama","Best Value on Capterra":"Capterra'da En İyi Değer","Leader on G2":"G2'de Lider","Left a 1-star rating. Needs improvemen